   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Para preguntar por primos, di **Have you got any cousins?** (**¿Tienes primos?**). **Any** suele usarse con sustantivos plurales en preguntas y negaciones.",
     "@en": "To ask for cousins, di **Have you got any cousins?** (**¿Tienes primos?**). **Any** is usually used with plural nouns in questions and negations."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Respuestas breves: **Yes, I have** o **No, I haven't**. Con **they**, responde **Yes, they have** o **No, they haven't**.",
     "@en": "Short answers: **Yes, I have** or **No, I haven't**. With **they**, respond **Yes, they have** or **No, they haven't**."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "vocabulario",
